# ${AGENT_NAME}

A Formicx autonomous agent created with the Formicx Agent SDK.

## Quickstart

```bash
# 1. Validate project structure
formicx agent validate .

# 2. Register agent with formicxd daemon
formicx agent register .

# 3. Start the agent
formicx agent start ${AGENT_NAME}

# 4. Check agent status
formicx agent status ${AGENT_NAME}
```
